schema: resource
object:
  title: Aave (lending protocol)
  type: resource
  url: https://aave.com/
  resource_type: protocol
  link_status: active
  notes: >-
    Cited twice in treasury-management.md — as a DeFi lending market where
    stablecoin holdings can be lent for yield, and as the example of a
    "reserve factor" mechanism where a portion of borrower interest flows
    directly to a protocol's ecosystem treasury as stablecoins (no token
    sales required). Also cited as a protocol DAOs can deposit native tokens
    into to borrow stablecoins without selling.
  related_concepts:
    - dao-treasury-diversification
